guide forever/class/mage/polymorph-pig
title Polymorph: Pig
category Class
class Mage
folder Mage
levels 60-60
zone Azshara
keywords Fragmented Magic, Archmage Xylem, Sanath Lim-yo, Warlord Krellian, Prismatic Shell, Ruins of Eldarath, Temple of Zin-Malor, Spitelash, Polymorph Clone, Polymorph, pig, Mage, class spell
reward spell 28272 "Polymorph: Pig"
why A new look for Polymorph: it turns the target into a pig rather than a sheep.

# Archmage Xylem's level 60 pair, both factions: Warlord Krellian (9362) and
# Fragmented Magic (9364), which teaches the pig Polymorph (spell 28272).
# Level 60: the Forever beta stops at 30 until launch on 4 November, so this
# guide is based on data, not play.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json for Xylem, Sanath Lim-yo,
# Warlord Krellian and the Polymorph Clones; travel.json for the Azshara flight
# points; Forever's Mage class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/, both unchanged), Forever's
# quest data (quest 9364) and spell data (spell 28272: "Polymorph",
# "Transforms the enemy into a pig"), checked 2026-10-14; the quest texts for
# the Temple of Zin-Malor and the clones. A Classic mage class quest guide
# (2023-11-09) places Krellian in the biggest building in the middle of
# the Ruins of Eldarath.
# Left out, not class quest chains: the raid and dungeon set quests Forever's
# quest data has for mages (Zul'Gurub 8060, 8068, 8069, 8101-8104, 8189; Ahn'Qiraj
# 8625, 8631-8634, 8691, 8699, 8707; Naxxramas 9095-9102, 9238-9240 and the
# Atiesh quests 9250, 9251, 9270; the Magister's set upgrade 8907, 8915, 8932,
# 8939, 8953, 9001, 9014, 9018). Magma or Lava? (84396, Jennea Cannon) wants a
# book none of our data drops; Research Access (97286, Garion Wendell) has no
# objective, reward or XP.

step Sanath Lim-yo
  tip Fly to Talrendis Point (Alliance) or Valormok (Horde). Sanath Lim-yo camps below Archmage Xylem's tower: from the fork of Azshara's main road at the Ruins of Eldarath, head straight north to the cliffs. He teleports you up to the Archmage.
  level 60
  accept 9362                                 -- Archmage Xylem

step Warlord Krellian
  tip Krellian hides behind his Spitelash guards in the Temple of Zin-Malor, the biggest building in the middle of the Ruins of Eldarath. He drops the Prismatic Shell.
  collect 23250 quest 9362.1                  -- Prismatic Shell: Warlord Krellian

step Archmage Xylem
  tip Back to Sanath Lim-yo and up to the tower.
  turnin 9362                                 -- Archmage Xylem
  accept 9364

step Polymorph Clones
  tip Carry the Prismatic Shell back to the Ruins of Eldarath. Polymorph a Spitelash naga and wait a few seconds: it splits into small Polymorph Clones. Kill the clones quickly; the shell collects their essence.
  kill 16479 quest 9364.1                     -- Polymorph Clone

step Fragmented Magic
  tip Back to Sanath Lim-yo and up to the tower.
  turnin 9364                                 -- Archmage Xylem: Polymorph (pig)
